<title>JAPAN: Sega, Bandai to brief media on subject of merger.</title>
<headline>Sega, Bandai to brief media on subject of merger.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sega Enterprises Ltd and Bandai Co Ltd said on Thursday they would hold a news conference on the subject of their merger at 3.40 p.m. (0640 GMT).</p>
<p>They did not elaborate further.</p>
</text>
